@* 2026-10-17: moved onto FeatureDemoLayout (row 9 of the Data Grid list) and turned from a "first-load bench" into the plain tree
   grid page the tracker asked for (SC-231). Gone, closing SC-226 to SC-230: the Benchmark button and the timing (the Stopwatch
   only wrapped list construction), the "40 / 180 / 480 nodes" labels (the grid loads 50 / 210 / 540 rows, groups included; the
   readout now counts them), the no-op Expanded handler (Expanded and Collapsed now feed the readout), "HomeFront's FItems",
   "Windows/VB6 folder styles" and the three competing titles. fx-treegrid-dotted-lines stays: it is a Showcase style (wwwroot/app.css:1639),
